   - ESLint rule `react-hooks/set-state-in-effect` forbids synchronous `setState` in an effect body → use `useSyncExternalStore` for mount-only browser capability reads.
   - Next dynamic segments are whole-segment: `[slug].md` is not a route, hence `/blog/[slug]/raw.md/route.ts`.
